# Normalize to LF everywhere.
#
# This repo is developed on Windows and runs in Linux containers, and several of
# its files must stay byte-stable across both:
#
#   * scenarios/*/fixtures/seed.sql is emitted by a committed generator script,
#     so a CRLF checkout would make regenerating it look like a change
#   * openapi.json and web/lib/api-types.ts are regenerated by a CI job that
#     fails on any diff, which a line-ending flip would trigger spuriously
#   * the compose services bind-mount the working tree straight into Linux
#
# Scenario config hashes normalize line endings themselves (see
# loader/hashing.py), so grading is unaffected either way -- this is about
# keeping diffs and CI honest.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Explicitly binary: never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.sqlite binary
*.db binary
